;========List of crimes========
;You can only be punished for one count of each crime per arrest.
;Murder is counted per person. If you did not initiate the battle you will not get any charges.
;A person resurrected with Recarm is not considered murder but just assault.
;For assault crimes its per person.
;Hitting a touhou 5 times with a gun is one count of Assault w/Deadly Weapon
;A non-lethal gun, fists, non damaging magic, and blunt melee is regular Assault
;Lethal guns, magic, bladed weapons is a Deadly Weapon
;Any weapon with an explosive effect, or multi-target -Dyne or higher magic is an Explosive Weapon
;Hitting cops gets you the more severe "Assault on on-duty LEO" variant.
;
;Rape is sexual assault and is treated the same as Assault with Deadly Weapon
;Theft
;Grand Theft is 100K+ yen stolen
;Petty Theft is anything less
